{
    "title": "Photoleap: Photo Editor/AI Art",
    "description": "Create remarkable digital AI art and striking photo compositions with Photoleap's robust AI image generator and image effects. As your go-to AI photo editor, Photoleap offers an array of AI professional photo editing tools and graphic design capabilities, providing a comprehensive suite of digital art features and filters for pictures.\r\n\r\nWhether you're starting from scratch, in search of an AI photo editor, or adding enchantment to your photos, Photoleap emerges as the ultimate all-in-one AI art generator app. Explore timeless photo effects like Colorize or Enhance or elevate your images with features such as Photo Animation, Text-to-image AI, and free 3D photo effects, many of which work offline.\r\n\r\nCUTTING-EDGE AI FEATURES\r\n- AI Headshot Generator: transform your selfies into polished, professional photos, achieving a refined look in seconds with Photoleap's AI headshot generator, the gold standard for AI professional photo enhancement\r\n- AI Yearbook: watch yourself evolve throughout the decades\r\n- AI Background Generator: use AI photo expand with a simple tap and explore limitless possibilities with AI background generator\r\n- AI Face Switch: easily swap faces in your photos and produce creative AI avatars with our innovative face swap features!\r\n\r\nHDR PHOTO EDITOR TO ENHANCE PHOTO QUALITY OF YOUR PICTURES\r\n- Picture retouch to create 8K HD photos out of old snapshots and enhance photo quality\r\n- Instant photo effects will revive & restore your images until they look brand new\r\n- Photo effects & advanced editing tools to sharpen pixelated or blurred pictures\r\n- Retouch old photos to look natural & realistic in one easy tap\r\n- Easy photo editing will refresh & colorize old photos and family portraits\r\n- Give color & brighten your memories with natural & easy-to-use photo editing tools\r\n- A large set of art filters for pictures and tools to enhance photo quality\r\n\r\nREPLACE BACKGROUND WITH AI IMAGE EDITOR\r\n- Easy photo editing, which will add stunning digital art to your photos with AI art generator\r\n- Try the background eraser to remove & replace objects, tweak opacity and emboss elements\r\n- Create clean packshots to use for social media & graphic design\r\n- Art photo effects to add visuals to your photo backdrop, change opacity or add emboss effect\r\n\r\nART PHOTO ANIMATOR\r\n- Create 3d photos and pictures with motion editing & effects\r\n- Add picture animation to make your photos come alive\r\n- Motion features to create 3d photo out of still image\r\n\r\nAI ART GENERATOR & HDR PHOTO EDITOR\r\n- Turn your selfies into works of art with AI headshot generator, the text to image AI generator and AI Face Switch face swap feature\r\n- Juxtapose your photos, pick an art style & watch your avatars come to life in 8K HD\r\n- Create abstract, deep dream AI paintings with advanced AI editor\r\n- New AI generator technology turns your selfies into whatever art style you dream of\r\n- Animate yourself into your paintings or cartoons, or design a completely new look\r\n\r\nPhotoleap AI Image Editor is new & improved with dozens of art filters for pictures, new art photo editing & AI features to help you create art out of your pictures!\r\n- Animate your art photos with live effects to turn your still image into 3d photo.\r\n- Create a customized AI avatar or an AI art with the text-to-image generator\r\n- Text-to-image AI generator and AI Face Switch to create images only you can dream of and play with face swap\r\n- Add dimensions, create 3d photo out of any picture\r\n- Colorize old photos to bring them back to life\r\n- Enhance old photos and remove any blur\r\n\r\nPhotoleap AI Image Editor is part of the award-winning Lightricks suite of apps, which includes a wide range of video and image editing solutions. Among them:\r\n- Videoleap, the Video Editing Tool\r\n- Facetune, the 8K HD Photo & Video Editing Tool for Selfies and Digital Art\r\n\r\nPhotoleap AI Picture Editor Terms: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/terms-of-use.html\r\nPhotoleap AI Picture Editor Policy: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/privacy-policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Create remarkable digital AI art and striking photo compositions with Photoleap&#39;s robust AI image generator and image effects. As your go-to AI photo editor, Photoleap offers an array of AI professional photo editing tools and graphic design capabilities, providing a comprehensive suite of digital art features and filters for pictures.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re starting from scratch, in search of an AI photo editor, or adding enchantment to your photos, Photoleap emerges as the ultimate all-in-one AI art generator app. Explore timeless photo effects like Colorize or Enhance or elevate your images with features such as Photo Animation, Text-to-image AI, and free 3D photo effects, many of which work offline.<br><br>CUTTING-EDGE AI FEATURES<br>- AI Headshot Generator: transform your selfies into polished, professional photos, achieving a refined look in seconds with Photoleap&#39;s AI headshot generator, the gold standard for AI professional photo enhancement<br>- AI Yearbook: watch yourself evolve throughout the decades<br>- AI Background Generator: use AI photo expand with a simple tap and explore limitless possibilities with AI background generator<br>- AI Face Switch: easily swap faces in your photos and produce creative AI avatars with our innovative face swap features!<br><br>HDR PHOTO EDITOR TO ENHANCE PHOTO QUALITY OF YOUR PICTURES<br>- Picture retouch to create 8K HD photos out of old snapshots and enhance photo quality<br>- Instant photo effects will revive &amp; restore your images until they look brand new<br>- Photo effects &amp; advanced editing tools to sharpen pixelated or blurred pictures<br>- Retouch old photos to look natural &amp; realistic in one easy tap<br>- Easy photo editing will refresh &amp; colorize old photos and family portraits<br>- Give color &amp; brighten your memories with natural &amp; easy-to-use photo editing tools<br>- A large set of art filters for pictures and tools to enhance photo quality<br><br>REPLACE BACKGROUND WITH AI IMAGE EDITOR<br>- Easy photo editing, which will add stunning digital art to your photos with AI art generator<br>- Try the background eraser to remove &amp; replace objects, tweak opacity and emboss elements<br>- Create clean packshots to use for social media &amp; graphic design<br>- Art photo effects to add visuals to your photo backdrop, change opacity or add emboss effect<br><br>ART PHOTO ANIMATOR<br>- Create 3d photos and pictures with motion editing &amp; effects<br>- Add picture animation to make your photos come alive<br>- Motion features to create 3d photo out of still image<br><br>AI ART GENERATOR &amp; HDR PHOTO EDITOR<br>- Turn your selfies into works of art with AI headshot generator, the text to image AI generator and AI Face Switch face swap feature<br>- Juxtapose your photos, pick an art style &amp; watch your avatars come to life in 8K HD<br>- Create abstract, deep dream AI paintings with advanced AI editor<br>- New AI generator technology turns your selfies into whatever art style you dream of<br>- Animate yourself into your paintings or cartoons, or design a completely new look<br><br>Photoleap AI Image Editor is new &amp; improved with dozens of art filters for pictures, new art photo editing &amp; AI features to help you create art out of your pictures!<br>- Animate your art photos with live effects to turn your still image into 3d photo.<br>- Create a customized AI avatar or an AI art with the text-to-image generator<br>- Text-to-image AI generator and AI Face Switch to create images only you can dream of and play with face swap<br>- Add dimensions, create 3d photo out of any picture<br>- Colorize old photos to bring them back to life<br>- Enhance old photos and remove any blur<br><br>Photoleap AI Image Editor is part of the award-winning Lightricks suite of apps, which includes a wide range of video and image editing solutions. Among them:<br>- Videoleap, the Video Editing Tool<br>- Facetune, the 8K HD Photo &amp; Video Editing Tool for Selfies and Digital Art<br><br>Photoleap AI Picture Editor Terms: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/terms-of-use.html<br>Photoleap AI Picture Editor Policy: https://static.lightricks.com/legal/privacy-policy.html",
